Q: Upgrading a Spring Boot project from JDK 8 to JDK 11 A: <p>Adding <em>source</em> and <em>target</em> compiler properties can work in <code>pom.xml</code> since upgrading to Java 11.</p>
<pre><code>&lt;properties&gt;
    &lt;maven.compiler.source&gt;11&lt;/maven.compiler.source&gt;
    &lt;maven.compiler.target&gt;11&lt;/maven.compiler.target&gt;
&lt;properties&gt;
</code></pre>

Q: Fetch tables using codeigniter issue, database A: <pre><code>  &lt;?php

    Class Crudmodel extends CI_Model{

        public function getRecords(){

            $this-&gt;db-&gt;select('s.*, c.nombre AS carrera')
                     -&gt;from('materias s')
                     -&gt;join('carreras c', 's.carrera_id = c.id', 'left');
            $q = $this-&gt;db-&gt;get();

            if($q -&gt; num_rows() &gt; 0){

                return $q-&gt;result();
            }

            return false;

        }

    }


?&gt;
</code></pre>

